sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Any visitor<br/>(human or crawler)
  participant F as Pages Function<br/>(page loads on public prefixes only)
  participant P as Cloudflare Pages<br/>(static files)
  participant A as Express API<br/>(unchanged, JSON only)
  C->>F: GET /wiki/commodities/agricium
  par
    F->>A: fetch commodity data (JSON, service token, edge-cached)
    A-->>F: JSON
  and
    F->>P: fetch index.html
    P-->>F: empty shell
  end
  Note over F: HTMLRewriter injects title, meta,<br/>JSON-LD and the answer-first summary text
  F-->>C: index.html with real head + summary
  Note over C: Crawler: done, it has content.<br/>Human: app JS loads and the SPA takes over,<br/>fetching JSON from the API exactly as today
